sCfo2\" id=\"sCfo2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ede56bd\" id=\"u7ede56bd\">2&gt; return退出状态码</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20calculator(int%20a%2C%20int%20b%2C%20int%20*add%2C%20int%20*sub)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctif%20((a%20%3E%20100)%20%7C%7C%20(b%20%3E%20100))%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctreturn%201%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct*add%20%3D%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%5Ct*sub%20%3D%20a%20-%20b%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctint%20x%20%3D%20101%3B%5Cn%5Ctint%20y%20%3D%2020%3B%5Cn%5Ctint%20total%3B%5Ct%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%202%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%5Ctint%20difference%3B%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%202%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%AE%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%5Ctint%20ret%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctret%20%3D%20calculator(x%2C%20y%2C%20%26total%2C%20%26difference)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctif%20(ret%20%3D%3D%200)%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctprintf(%5C%22total%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20total)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctprintf(%5C%22difference%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20difference)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%20else%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctprintf(%5C%22%E5%8F%AA%E5%87%86%E5%87%BA100%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A0%E5%87%8F%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GlXlz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4032a161\" id=\"u4032a161\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf63edc22\" id=\"uf63edc22\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0df2404c\" id=\"u0df2404c\">程序可以通过return返回一个整数值，通常称为“退出状态码”或“退出码”，用于指示程序在执行过程中是否成功或其他信息；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d36a413\" id=\"u9d36a413\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52393552\" id=\"u52393552\">通常，返回0表示执行成功，非0表示执行过程中出现了错误，不同的值可以定义不同的错误；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NHyZk%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"Mn0zf\" id=\"Mn0zf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u935c114a\" id=\"u935c114a\">3&gt; 指针-捞数据</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F**%5Cn%20*%20strcpy%20-%20Copy%20a%20%25NUL%20terminated%20string%5Cn%20*%20%40dest%3A%20Where%20to%20copy%20the%20string%20to%5Cn%20*%20%40src%3A%20%20Where%20to%20copy%20the%20string%20from%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cnchar%20*strcpy(char%20*dest%2C%20const%20char%20*src)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctchar%20*tmp%20%3D%20dest%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctwhile%20((*dest%2B%2B%20%3D%20*src%2B%2B)%20!%3D%20'%5C%5C0')%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%2F*%20nothing%20*%2F%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%20tmp%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctchar%20a%5B20%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22Hello%2C%20world!%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Ctchar%20b%5B50%5D%20%3D%20%7B%200%20%7D%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctstrcpy(b%2C%20a)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20b)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jPjfc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufe72f5d3\" id=\"ufe72f5d3\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F43021193%2F1725882161945-3d5172a9-3969-4bad-8bea-f35ffa03752f.png%22%2C%